   "en": "Taoist Academy Muwigwan"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "Daoist Academy Muwigwan"
   },
   {
    "ko": "도사 아카데미 무위관"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "If there's Hogwarts, a wizarding school in England, then there's Muwigwan in South Korea.\n\nThe story of Jeong Tae-mi, an ordinary high school girl who was forced to enroll in a martial arts school, and her greedy life as a college entrance exam taker who can't give up her training to become a Taoist priest, begins with her turbulent growth.\n\nI don't have a grand mission to protect the Earth, nor do I want to learn Taoism and become a Taoist.\n\nIt would be good to experience a little more—the world that Muwigwan will show you and the connections you'll make here.\n\nKeep going for now!"
  },
